{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>But the Levite, he shall serve.</b> By himself. And some say it is a pu'al (passive participle), but this is not correct, for 'the service of the Tent of Meeting' is the object of the action." "<b>And they shall bear their iniquity.</b> If they do not guard it. Now, the tithe is their inheritance; therefore I have said."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:18.872914519Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}